{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46937","headline":"闻道林诸友尝茶因有寄 · 齐己","name":"闻道林诸友尝茶因有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枪旗冉冉绿丛园，谷雨初晴叫杜鹃。\n摘带岳华蒸晓露，碾和松粉煮春泉。\n高人梦惜藏岩里，白硾封题寄火前。\n应念苦吟耽睡起，不堪无过夕阳天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}